WEBVTT

NOTE Written dialogue uses provisional timing; no recorded speech.

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:00.700
[Soft breeze]

2
00:00:00.800 --> 00:00:05.200
Koeli: Listen once more—kuhu!

3
00:00:05.300 --> 00:00:11.200
[Two-note call sketch]

4
00:00:13.000 --> 00:00:17.600
Child: Wait. Can you hear that little sound?

5
00:00:18.800 --> 00:00:19.800
[A drop taps the leaf]

6
00:00:24.400 --> 00:00:25.200
[Another drop taps]

7
00:00:25.500 --> 00:00:30.500
Koeli: All that sound from one little drop!

8
00:00:32.300 --> 00:00:33.300
[Tap; the leaf dips]

9
00:00:36.800 --> 00:00:40.500
Koeli: This time I’ll listen too.

10
00:00:42.000 --> 00:00:46.700
[Two drops; a light breeze]
